{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"natlan_nightsoul","name_zh":"夜魂","name_en":"Nightsoul","aliases":["夜魂","Nightsoul"],"category":"power_system","scope":"regional","regions":["Natlan"],"summary":"夜魂是居于Natlan夜神之国的死者灵魂。Natlan战士能够借用夜魂的力量强化自身，并由此使用Nightsoul's Blessing、Nightsoul Transmission和Nightsoul Bursts。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"natlan_nightsoul_fact_01","text":"夜魂是存在于夜神之国的灵魂；Natlan的死者会进入该领域，并最终逐渐失去自我、融入灵魂之海。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"一般规律","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_nightsoul_02"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_nightsoul_fact_02","text":"Natlan战士能够借用夜魂的力量增强战斗能力；这种力量使他们能够使用Nightsoul's Blessing、Nightsoul Transmission和Nightsoul Bursts。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现行力量体系","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_natlan_nightsoul_02"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_nightsoul_fact_03","text":"Nightsoul's Blessing会在使用者身上表现为一种强化行动与战斗能力的状态，而且该状态在Natlan境内会得到进一步增强。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现行力量体系","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_nightsoul","fandom_sup_natlan_nightsoul_01"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_nightsoul_fact_04","text":"进入Nightsoul's Blessing状态时，使用者会获得一定数量的Nightsoul points；这些力量点会在状态持续期间被维持，并可依使用者的能力取得或消耗。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"Nightsoul's Blessing状态持续期间","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_nightsoul","fandom_sup_natlan_nightsoul_01"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_nightsoul_fact_05","text":"在Nightsoul's Blessing状态中，Nightsoul points耗尽或无法使用时，燃素可以作为替代能源被消耗。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"Nightsoul's Blessing状态持续期间","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_nightsoul","fandom_sup_natlan_nightsoul_05"]}],"timeline":[],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"Natlan当地人可能知道夜魂与夜神之国的死者灵魂有关，也可能知道战士可以借其力量强化自身；具体的力量点运作和燃素替代机制更可能属于使用者或相关专业人士掌握的知识。","likely_known_by":["使用Nightsoul's Blessing的Natlan战士","熟悉夜神之国与当地力量传统的Natlan人士"],"unlikely_known_by":["未接触Natlan力量传统的外地普通居民"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":[]},"activation_keys":["夜魂","Nightsoul"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["触发Nightsoul Burst时的屏幕边缘提示、队伍构成条件及具体时间间隔","角色头像亮起、切换角色、冲刺、攀爬、游泳、跳跃等操作说明","各角色技能、天赋、圣遗物效果及其具体数值","伤害倍率、抗打断、移动速度、冷却时间、点数上限与恢复数值","Nightsoul-aligned伤害的具体战斗破盾用途"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["夜魂的具体形成过程、个体意识状态及其力量被战士调用和转化的完整原理","未获中文核验的衍生术语中文正式名","关于其他概念的神话类比、词源推测及Wiki编辑者推断"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_natlan_nightsoul","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Nightsoul&#039;s Blessing","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Nightsoul","language":"en","revision_id":"1960342","source_text_sha256":"f379cf075ad6d9cae65c1a370e2a592cab7da076525fccc626be9b181c273dd7"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_nightsoul_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Nightsoul&#039;s Blessing","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Nightsoul's_Blessing","language":"en","revision_id":"1960342","source_text_sha256":"9df9da38d25eeacd241939475751def76cbb4b682d23b61f5ad85cb7ecd2dc85"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_nightsoul_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Night Kingdom","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Night_Kingdom","language":"en","revision_id":"2115456","source_text_sha256":"d8ac6f11c753e5c5b231aa07ee26cc037171a8bd79afa1443bf23f12a594fbfa"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_nightsoul_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Wayob","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Wayob","language":"en","revision_id":"2133595","source_text_sha256":"612fdc29b4140d7dc728fe1b950b984b6ec51df8ee464fe20d210c32b05e1519"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_nightsoul_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Ancient Name","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Ancient_Name","language":"en","revision_id":"2125348","source_text_sha256":"6db90cbf8b5858e6becdd3f1cf980b9d78539064a743572349294714757abe58"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_natlan_nightsoul_05","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Phlogiston","url":